Pause a meeting and resume it: nothing is recorded or transcribed while paused, and it stays one recording. Filing works like iOS: tap a folder to select it, then Save; organization folders have their own sections, and Move to… is in the recording's header. Swiping between folders follows your finger, and the library refreshes when you come back. Screens no longer sit under the navigation bar or camera cutout. A recording the server refuses is kept and retried, never deleted.